    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d470">

                <pb facs="0595" n="483" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg483"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 814.48/32</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Guatemala</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Thurston</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-13T21:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 13, 1918, 9 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>There will be at least 20 destitute Americans for refugee vessels. What will be
                    done for them upon arrival United States? Many live in interior states.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Thurston</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
